# Environment Configuration Example
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your actual values

# ============================================
# Environment Type
# ============================================
# development: Local development environment
# production: Production environment
NODE_ENV=development

# ============================================
# Database Configuration (Choose ONE option)
# ============================================

# Option 1: Supabase (Production/Cloud)
# Get these values from your Supabase project dashboard
# 1. Go to https://supabase.com/dashboard
# 2. Select your project
# 3. Go to Settings > API
# 4. Copy the values below

# Supabase Project URL
# Get from: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API → Project URL
# 注意：当前项目只在服务端使用 Supabase，不需要 NEXT_PUBLIC_ 前缀
# Note: Current project only uses Supabase on server-side, no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix needed
# SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co

# Supabase Anon Key (必需 - Required)
# Get from: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API → anon public key
# 注意：当前项目只在服务端使用，不需要 NEXT_PUBLIC_ 前缀
# 虽然 Anon Key 是公开的，但遵循最佳实践：只在需要的地方暴露
# Note: Current project only uses on server-side, no NEXT_PUBLIC_ prefix needed
# Although Anon Key is public, following best practice: only expose where needed
# SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# Supabase Service Role Key (可选 - Optional)
# Get from: Supabase Dashboard → Settings → API → service_role key
# ⚠️ 这是私密密钥，绝对不能暴露在前端！只在服务端使用
# ⚠️ This is a private key, NEVER expose in client-side code! Server-side only
# 当前项目不需要此密钥，除非需要执行管理员操作或绕过 RLS
# Current project doesn't need this unless you need admin operations or bypass RLS
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=your-service-role-key-here

# Option 2: Local PostgreSQL (Development)
# Use this for local PostgreSQL database connection

# PostgreSQL Host (default: localhost)
DB_HOST=localhost

# PostgreSQL Port (default: 5432)
DB_PORT=5432

# PostgreSQL Username
DB_USER=postgres

# PostgreSQL Password
DB_PASSWORD=your-password

# PostgreSQL Database Name
DB_NAME=your-database-name

# ============================================
# Notes
# ============================================
# 1. Database connection is REQUIRED for usage statistics
# 2. Choose EITHER Supabase OR Local PostgreSQL (not both)
# 3. If both are provided, Supabase will be used first
# 4. The app will fail to start if no database credentials are provided
# 5. Never commit .env.local to Git (it's in .gitignore)
# 6. Only commit env.example as a template
